WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:16.800
The continent of Kunaan was 
ruled by sword and sorcery.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.340
Three powerful countries existed there.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:26.590
The Kingdom of Saint Amoria, 
the Kingdom of Ishilfeen,

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.190
and the Kingdom of Vanlodis.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.270
They were all equally powerful,

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.790
and it was clear that any trouble in one

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:39.720
would immediately start
a continent-wide war.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:47.360
And there was an evil dragon on 
the continent that all men feared.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.480
His name was Dagan Zot.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:59.810
He came from the shadows to scorch the 
earth and devour the souls of mankind.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:07.300
This is the story of Dagan Zot, 
and the young swordsman, Hiiro.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.070
Young Master!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.910
Hiiro-sama!

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:22.840
Young Master!

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.010
Young Master!

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:47.930
Stop it!

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:50.870
That's not something for 
humans to get involved in!

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:00.050
What?

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:03.090
Dagan Zot protected them?

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.560
What?

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:26.120
Is that the real Dagan Zot?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.370
This is bad!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.440
This is going too far, Nambuuko!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.110
How could you summon Dagan Zot?

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:08.820
Did you go mad with fear?

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.170
No, I'm quite sane.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.890
The terror has revived after ten years.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.190
What could be more splendid?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.370
The people shall fear Dagan Zot,

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:25.760
and in their fear they shall kneel
before you for your protection.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.970
If you have the power to 
protect them, that is.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.400
Dagan Zot, the creature that will bring

00:05:33.400 --> 00:05:36.090
disaster to this entire continent, has returned!

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:37.770
For my sake!

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:40.900
Attend me!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.850
We return now to the Land Where Wishes Die.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.620
What's going on?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.690
What was Dagan Zot doing there?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:05.990
Ten years ago, Young Master 
Hiiro's father, Lord Bairo,

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.300
and his wife, Kissmeteete-sama,

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.440
tried to seal Dagan Zot away. 
You know that, right?

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.970
Yeah. The Disaster at Balbagoa, right?

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.390
That's right.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:20.480
Why'd they pick the buffer zone between the 
three countries as the place to seal it?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.020
That's dangerous.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:26.410
The Kingdom of Saint Amoria, 
the Kingdom of Ishilfeen,

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.520
and the Kingdom of Vanlodis.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.870
All of them feared Dagan Zot,

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.100
to the point where they didn't want to 
do the sealing in their own country.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:39.620
As a result, the buffer zone was chosen.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.310
What a pain.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:46.510
The noble soul of Kissmeteete 
was used to lure Dagan Zot.

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.360
And with Bairo-sama's Sealing Treasure,

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.040
Kissmeteete's Sword of God,

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.640
and the young master's Holy Mirror,

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.270
as well as the power of a hundred mages,

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.940
the sealing looked like 
it would succeed, but...

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:14.690
<i>Father! Mother!</i>

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:20.270
Bairo-sama, as well as a 
hundred elite mages

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:25.380
and many of the three kingdom's soldiers
were covered in the Soul-Devouring flames.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.320
The Soul-Devouring flames?

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:30.790
Flames that devour even the soul.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:35.760
Anyone slain by them cannot 
be revived by any magic.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.590
Which means his mom and dad...

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:47.940
Young Master!

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:50.120
Dagan Zot!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.130
Young Master!

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.280
Where am I?

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.080
This kid's place.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.290
I'm not a kid. Call me Tomitte-sama.

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.980
Where's Dagan Zot?!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.380
Young Master, he's gone.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.420
Let me go!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.920
I have to defeat him!

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:09.490
Are you stupid?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.150
You think you can defeat 
Dagan Zot with your skills?

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:14.930
How?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.980
He's an evil dragon.

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.560
Even a hundred mages couldn't beat him.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.630
Shut up!

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.310
I've trained for this day!

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:05.860
I trained every day for ten years 
to avenge my mother and father!

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.930
My master is Giruu.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.480
If you think that you'll get results 
just because you tried hard,

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.860
you're a moron.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:19.000
If I get serious...

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:23.580
My real power is nothing like that!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.900
Amazing.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.270
The Grand Trowa...

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.370
The Grand Trowa can grant any wish!

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.880
So you could use it to defeat Dagan Zot!

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.330
That's it.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.790
I'm sure my father was trying 
to do the same thing.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.220
If I get that back, I can defeat him!

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.390
Isn't that the Sealing Treasure?

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.230
Nambuuko, was it?

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:48.600
Where is he?

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.820
He left a long time ago.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.190
Where does he live?

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:55.360
I don't care where he lives.

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.210
What? So you don't know anything?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.670
He's a nasty arms merchant.

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:05.620
He's trying to make people and countries 
fight each other so he can get rich!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:08.120
Each time he comes here,

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.980
he buys magic stones for almost nothing.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:14.820
And it's the weak who pay the price.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.010
Thanks to him the lord of 
this town is flat broke,

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:24.260
and they say he's raised the taxes and is 
keeping a set of double books for himself.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.950
Okay, got it.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:29.870
I'll find Nambuuko and 
get back the Grand Trowa,

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:31.370
then defeat Dagan Zot.

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:33.480
Sounds like a pain.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:34.820
Let's go!

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:42.150
Finding Nambuuko is fine, but 
you've got nowhere to begin.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.010
We should head back to the mansion.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.750
You always told me a man never looks back.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.100
But traveling's expensive.

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.080
Oh, right. Hiiro.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.130
You took a month of my living expenses.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.330
I'll just give them back.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.850
One, two, three.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.790
Young Master.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.920
I'm not going home, and stop calling me that.

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:09.700
Hey, Hiiro-kun.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:12.090
The Maney Gold has vanished.

00:11:12.090 --> 00:11:13.810
What did you use it on?

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:18.340
Oh, this.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.320
The Crest of Dalhalbart.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:24.210
Y-You paid gold for this fake?

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.100
You stupid kid!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:28.170
I'll shove my hand up 
your ass, out your nose,

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:31.920
and then into your mouth so 
you can eat your own boogers!

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.750
But he said it was real.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:39.010
Even a four-year old would know 
better than to believe that.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.760
Now I'm mad!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:44.980
I'll rip a hole in your stomach 
and shove in a paipaipai tree,

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.730
then send a sand dragon after you!

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.970
Wait, you stupid kid!

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.890
You know I've got short legs!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:09.910
I guess Nambuuko-sama has gone 
back to the Land Where Wishes Die.

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:14.490
He wouldn't leave me behind!

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.760
Mirror, mirror, mirror!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.540
Let me see him.

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:31.560
<i>I'm so glad you're safe!</i>

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:32.720
What?

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:33.700
<i>"What?"</i>

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:36.920
<i>Aww, you're so cold.</i>

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:40.980
<i>Are you leaving your beautiful 
Sharisharu behind?</i>

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:42.240
That's right!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:47.070
You're... You're leaving 
me in this stupid town?

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.290
<i>Find that boy.</i>

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.270
<i>The one Dagan Zot protected.</i>

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.370
Nambuuko-sama!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.450
Boy?

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.340
I'm hungry.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.290
Let's eat something.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:09.940
It's decided.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:16.270
No spending money.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:23.720
You're the ones who caused 
that fuss this morning, right?

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.080
We don't want any trouble.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:27.490
Leave!

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.250
What's going on?

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:31.190
We can't even get it to go?

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.950
What a bunch of jerks!

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.380
It's probably because we opposed Nambuuko.

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:38.920
He seems to have a lot of 
influence in Iinsekise.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.560
Who cares about Nambuuko?!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.800
Hey!

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.550
I know a place you can eat at.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.390
Really?

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.480
You stink like a cat.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.210
Follow me.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.390
You don't work,

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.250
but you sure do eat, right?

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:09.160
I'm a growing boy.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:13.410
You know how much money 
it takes to raise a kid?

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:17.640
You're eating an expensive 
dragon rib roast, aren't you?

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:19.000
Eat some vegetables!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.460
With my mouth like this,

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.040
if I eat vegetables they'll 
get stuck in my teeth!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:24.090
How is it?

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.970
Oh, you.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:26.840
Is it good?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.550
Yeah, it's all good.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:33.720
You really did introduce us to a good place.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.860
It was nothing...

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.830
You're the guy who caused all that 
fuss in the plaza this morning, right?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.180
Yeah, I guess so.

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:42.440
What was Dagan Zot doing there?

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.690
No clue.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:48.450
Does it have to do something to 
do with you being Bairo's son?

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:57.870
How do you know that?

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:02.000
I don't know. How do I know that?

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:08.040
My name's Erin.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.720
Remember it, Hiiro-kun.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.600
What was her problem?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:16.510
Young Master, you must not let yourself 
be deceived by a pretty girl.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.620
You're one to talk!

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.040
Let's go.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.960
Check please!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.370
Sure. For your guest, too.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:25.280
Guest?

00:15:25.280 --> 00:15:26.520
That girl you were with.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.650
She said you'd pay.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:30.780
What?

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.070
That stupid bitch!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.560
I thought she worked here!

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:35.740
She didn't?

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.680
Well, it's not like we 
can do anything about it.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.230
Now we need to find a place to stay.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.190
What are you talking about?

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.430
We're sleeping outside tonight.

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:44.250
Of course we are.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:49.400
You used all my Maney gold and 
then I had to pay for that woman!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.300
No way...

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.580
Yes way!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:57.760
I won't let you use a single 
Maney without my permission!

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.320
I know!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.730
So we're staying here.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.690
Wait!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.010
You can't just decide that!

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:09.030
You guys are a nuisance!

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.130
Can't you tell?

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:14.110
We're a nuisance, 
but we're staying here anyway.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.470
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:17.950
Anyway, no.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:21.870
Boss, they saved my life.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.040
Let's let them stay just for the night.

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:27.620
Just for one night.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.050
Good kid.

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.860
Okay, I'll sleep here.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:33.230
That's my spot!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.850
It's okay. I won't let it bother me!

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.890
It's not okay!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.300
Hurry up and move!

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:40.460
The young master was all 
alone at the mansion,

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:42.370
You're such a meanie!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.840
and now he has friends.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.810
Glad to see 'em getting along.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.750
We're not friends!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.350
Wow!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.490
Breakfast time.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.520
Let's eat!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.440
That was great.

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:30.660
So what are you going to do now?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.360
You going after Nambuuko?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:33.510
Yeah.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.500
I'm getting back the Grand Trowa.

00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:37.160
We can't do that yet.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:40.400
Your skills as a swordsman are unpolished.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.080
If you go out into the wilderness now,

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:46.890
you'll meet monsters you can't 
even imagine on the road.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.980
I'm not afraid of monsters.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.720
Your job right now is

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:56.880
to become a better swordsman who 
can at least survive on the roads.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:59.310
Fine.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:01.750
We'll stay here for a while,

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:04.390
as you learn to fight monsters.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.570
And if you're going to go on a journey,

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:09.400
we'll need equipment.

00:18:09.800 --> 00:18:12.400
Not that we have the cash.

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:13.970
Wait.

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.900
We said it would just be for a night.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.630
Don't be such a stiff.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.540
This is a small room.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.740
Giruu will cook every day.

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:26.820
Fine!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.840
So we're going to have you train.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:36.010
First up, slimes.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.820
These are slimes?

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:39.530
Indeed.

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.020
They may look like plants,

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.430
but when the time comes 
they create baby slimes.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.140
Newborn slimes have no poison,

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:51.080
so they're perfect for you to practice.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.490
Don't make fun of me.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.900
I'll chop this thing in half.

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:01.830
What is this?

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:05.650
I didn't have time to say this,

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.610
but slime babies are surprisingly fast.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.400
I need a big sword!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.760
I can't do it because my sword's so tiny.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.090
No, that's the perfect size for this.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.320
Now get ready.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:24.890
The next ones are coming.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:36.400
Hey, Giruu!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.840
These things are dangerous!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:39.320
Let me do something else!

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.820
Wait!

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:44.210
Hey, I think you know this,

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:46.740
but Hiiro has no talent as a swordsman.

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.440
My only talent is teaching the sword.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.500
You can be an amazing teacher,

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.010
but it won't help if you're teaching that.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.690
I'll go defeat two or three monsters.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:58.590
Yeah.

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.370
We need money.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.300
Good luck.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.250
It's because slimes are so small.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:10.010
If it was something bigger...

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.050
Yup.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.440
You won't get any cash from those things.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:16.550
You gotta defeat something stronger!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:24.950
Hey, Palupa.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:26.800
What about a sand dragon?

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.920
That's a good choice.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.700
You can get a ton for their fangs.

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.710
The meat and pelt is worth a lot, too.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:38.280
We'd have enough money to do 
whatever we wanted for a while.

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.470
It'd be sweet.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:41.630
Yeah?

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.130
Sweet, huh?

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:46.180
What? I'm not a sand dragon!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.350
A real dragon!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.220
Hiiro!

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:55.310
No! Run!

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:58.550
A hero never leaves a good deed undone!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:00.570
That's not heroic, it's stupid!

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.040
Who's there?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.040
Thank you, Mr. Dragon.

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:29.280
Farewell.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.440
Be well.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:45.310
H-Hey, wait—

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.510
Beat, beat, beat.

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:55.930
Beat, beat, beat, beat.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:00.460
The sound of your heart 
is a very pretty sound.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.180
I like it.

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:07.430
Come with me.

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:47.470
<i>Holy War Cerberus: Fatalité of Dragon Time.</i>

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:51.120
Episode 3: "The Hidden Fortress."

00:23:48.310 --> 00:23:55.870
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:51.770 --> 00:23:54.410
My sword shall embed itself 
within the freezing ground!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:01.500
<b>Look Forward to the Next Episode!!</b>
